### Quick manual tests for the API.
### Open in VS Code with the "REST Client" extension and click "Send Request" above each block.
### Cookies are kept between requests, so sign in first.

@api = http://localhost:4000

### Health check (database up?)
GET {{api}}/health

### Sign in (use the email/password from your .env SEED_ADMIN_*)
POST {{api}}/v1/admin/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@papertree.com.bd",
  "password": "change-me-please"
}

### Who am I?
GET {{api}}/v1/admin/auth/me

### List roles
GET {{api}}/v1/admin/roles

### Create a role
POST {{api}}/v1/admin/roles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Order Staff",
  "description": "Handles orders and customers",
  "modules": ["orders", "customers"],
  "canImpersonate": true
}

### List staff
GET {{api}}/v1/admin/staff

### Add a staff member (change roleId to the id of the role you created)
POST {{api}}/v1/admin/staff
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rahim Uddin",
  "email": "rahim@papertree.com.bd",
  "password": "rahim-password-1",
  "roleId": 2
}

### Disable a staff member (change the id)
PATCH {{api}}/v1/admin/staff/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "disabled"
}

### Change my password
POST {{api}}/v1/admin/auth/change-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "change-me-please",
  "newPassword": "a-new-strong-password"
}

### Sign out
POST {{api}}/v1/admin/auth/logout
